/**
 * The steering parameters the ch13 route traversals actually publish.
 *
 * Read-only, and read by the navigation-seam regression in
 * `autopilot/primitives.test.ts`: that seam has to be measured against the goal
 * the rail REALLY publishes on the REAL terrain, because a transcription of
